That’s very true Ghall.  It takes a LOT of work to get to the point where you can bank, buy, sell, and quest, inside Kael.  But DAMN does it rock to watch people get smoked by some giant while your standing there selling off some velium weapons. &#61514;  <P>Killing Coldain is probably your quickest way to gain faction with Kael, since killing Coldain gives positive faction hits to both Kromzek AND Kromrif, and negative to both Coldain and DainFrostReaverIV.  Killing in Skyshrine only gets you positive faction with Kromzek, and negative with ClawsofVeeshan and Yelinak.  I think the positive faction hits on the dwarves in East Wastes are pretty good also.  It has taken me about 16 hours at that camp to go from dubious to allied with Kromrif.  It only took me about half that time to get to the point where I was safe to bank, but then, I was already allied to Kromzek when I started on the dwarves.  From what I understand, the dorfs give a bigger hit for Kromrif, than they do for Kromzek, so killing in both places (Skyshrine and East Wastes) would probably be your best bet.  And killing in skyshrine opens up the opportunity for armor and stuff.  Killing coldain gets you nothing but faction, exp, and a little plat.<P>--------------------<P>Lownar Baardeth - 54th Level Gnecromancer<BR>Kalaan - 30th Level Rogue<BR>Bertox. Server<P>Sendil- 50th Level Rogue<BR>Solusek Ro Server
